# Privacy Policy for English Vocabulary

**Last updated: October 6, 2026**

English Vocabulary is a browser extension designed to help users collect, research, organize, and study English words and phrases encountered while browsing the web.

## Information the Extension Processes

### Selected webpage content

When you select text on a webpage, English Vocabulary may process the selected text in order to display its vocabulary toolbar and provide vocabulary-related actions.

The extension does not automatically collect the contents of webpages you visit.

### Vocabulary data

When you choose to save vocabulary, the extension stores information associated with your vocabulary library, which may include:

- words and phrases;
- definitions;
- translations;
- examples;
- notes;
- pronunciation text;
- learning status and group;
- topics and stacks;
- favorites and organizational information.

This information is stored in your browser using Chrome's extension storage.

### Pronunciation recordings

If you use the personal pronunciation recording feature, your recordings are stored locally in your browser.

Pronunciation recordings are not uploaded to a server operated by English Vocabulary.

### Extension preferences

The extension may store settings and preferences required for its functionality.

## External Language Resources

English Vocabulary provides shortcuts to third-party language resources such as online dictionaries, pronunciation resources, and contextual language-search services.

When you explicitly choose one of these services, the selected word or phrase may be included in the URL or request sent to that third-party service.

Those services operate under their own privacy policies. English Vocabulary does not control how third-party websites process information after you choose to visit them.

## Import and Export

English Vocabulary allows users to import and export vocabulary data.

These operations occur only when initiated by the user. The extension does not automatically upload exported vocabulary files to a server operated by English Vocabulary.

## Information We Do Not Collect

English Vocabulary does not collect or sell:

- personally identifiable information;
- health information;
- financial or payment information;
- authentication information or passwords;
- personal communications;
- precise location information;
- browsing history.

The extension does not use advertising trackers or analytics services.

## Data Sharing and Selling

English Vocabulary does not sell user data.

English Vocabulary does not transfer user data to third parties for advertising, profiling, creditworthiness, or unrelated purposes.

Information may be sent to a third-party language resource only when the user explicitly chooses to open or use that resource.

## Data Storage

Vocabulary information and extension settings are stored using browser storage associated with the extension.

Personal pronunciation recordings are stored locally using browser storage.

Removing the extension may remove locally stored extension data. Users are encouraged to use the extension's export functionality if they want to retain a backup of their vocabulary library.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated when the functionality of English Vocabulary changes. The latest version will be published at this URL.

## Contact

For questions about this Privacy Policy, please use the contact information provided on the English Vocabulary Chrome Web Store listing.
